        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This red maple wand carved into a tongue of flame feels warm in your hand.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day, plus overcharge</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Revealing Light]. For the duration of the spell, you can use the limning flames as a source for your magic. Creatures affected by your revealing light must succeed at a Will save against your spell DC or take a –2 status penalty to their Will saves against spells with the illusion or mental trait as long as they are affected by revealing light. You can cast a spell with the illusion or mental trait on such a creature up to a distance equal to twice the spell's normal range. If the spell has a range of touch or doesn't have a range, it's unaffected by the increase in range from revealing light.</p><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply a casting of revealing light.</p>"
